{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7001_p", "source_sha256": "cbd1c1535c6d1c39858cee389e920e20c62655d8d0c327645c602624a06e0afc", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n可奈のテーマは『秘宝を守るドラゴン』だが……）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄开始了。\n可奈的主题是“守护秘宝的巨龙”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7002_036kan", "source_sha256": "958d9c91a63982d27583a0b0940686bfb067c1b01d223f93b80ddc7953716e6a", "ja": "可奈は欲張りドラゴンだ～、秘宝は誰にも渡さない～♪\nでもでもバトルは得意じゃな～い！", "zh": "可奈是贪心的大恶龙～，秘宝谁也不给～♪\n可是可是可奈并不擅长战斗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7003_p", "source_sha256": "327d0b4a4c7420135160a6c43c504d97a85dd37f0b41dc5ca310e5e86215d2d5", "ja": "そうか……。それなら、戦わないで秘宝を守る方法を\n一緒に考えてみようか。", "zh": "这样啊……既然如此，那我们一起想想不战斗也能守护秘宝的办法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7004_036kan", "source_sha256": "5755b221b2b8e13b2824a4ddabb7bc87e3fbbb84cd3d429385611eda649aba9c", "ja": "はれっ！？　今の聞いて……って、\n戦わなくてもいい方法があるんですか！？", "zh": "咦！？听到刚才那番话……等等，难道有不用战斗的方法吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7005_036kan", "source_sha256": "2b911da284807262b02d7d30c841e842ee0c0d5e67da4b051a926d27f04aecc2", "ja": "私、ドラゴンみたいに強そうにできるか心配で……。\n{$P$}さん、ヒントをください！", "zh": "我很担心自己能不能表现得像龙一样强大……。\n{$P$}先生，请给我一些提示吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7006_p", "source_sha256": "b76c80d4cf362be89a06ef77e7adee45e54fe98bdf9ee4b00c31006493e4e2aa", "ja": "ヒントか……。\nそうだな、例えば……。", "zh": "提示啊……\n嗯，比如说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7007", "source_sha256": "55028fdb2724f5f890de8bda0b97c59b5536ce789cab9ee0cc4310f0b7dfcb09", "ja": "仲良し作戦", "zh": "要好作战", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7008", "source_sha256": "66c2333c157dac8f970f251d6a17cbe46680c922dd456a7dc9fab7f1c662b144", "ja": "威嚇で撃退", "zh": "恐吓击退", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7200_p", "source_sha256": "8fb762fe8a0f14261ba9b1f72dbca11d8c1befd767dc8f574396de418f18168a", "ja": "侵入者と友達になるのはどうだろう？\n誰とでも仲良くなれるのは、可奈の強みだと思うんだ。", "zh": "和侵入者成为朋友怎么样？\n能和任何人打好关系，我认为是可奈的强项。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7201_036kan", "source_sha256": "683657e49be296fce239c7e9ccfdda7625195aabc3d94be0ec5a85431ca8dd0d", "ja": "わあ、すごく素敵ですねっ♪\n秘宝を守れて、お友達も増えるなんて……よーし！", "zh": "哇，真是太棒了♪  \n既能守护秘宝，又能交到更多朋友……好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7202_036kan", "source_sha256": "380a24dc199ef6bb9d58a64a59c00c5c68e9b5411f5616431ff0b050fbdae77b", "ja": "私の名前は矢吹可奈～♪　ドラゴンだけど優しいよ～♪\n仲良くしてくれるかな～♪　友達は最高のお宝だ～♪", "zh": "我的名字是矢吹可奈～♪虽然是龙，但很温柔哦～♪\n愿意和我好好相处吗～♪朋友就是最棒的宝藏啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7300_p", "source_sha256": "8fb762fe8a0f14261ba9b1f72dbca11d8c1befd767dc8f574396de418f18168a", "ja": "侵入者と友達になるのはどうだろう？\n誰とでも仲良くなれるのは、可奈の強みだと思うんだ。", "zh": "和侵入者成为朋友怎么样？\n能和任何人打好关系，我认为是可奈的强项。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7301_036kan", "source_sha256": "1b20301c7b670e071e46df432a80e938a71fc1ba840a5dde334f82d6aa937d16", "ja": "仲良くですか？　じゃあ洞窟の入口でお迎えしなきゃ！\nあっ。それだと秘宝から離れなくちゃいけないし……。", "zh": "要和它们友好吗？那就得在洞窟入口迎接它们才行！  \n啊，可那样就得离开秘宝了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7302_036kan", "source_sha256": "7c0f0ca889aae8fccffd797d32ae60b06d90ce3e8a8b3611ac16ee758767f1e3", "ja": "うーん……私がいない間、取られないようにするには\nお宝を隠しちゃうとか？　でも、どこに隠そう～！？", "zh": "嗯……在我不在的时候，要防止宝物被拿走的话，\n要不把宝物藏起来？可是，该藏到哪里好呢～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7500_p", "source_sha256": "f43b2b6ac45c9a99d6e7202b69cfee1871bea77f4353c1791bbd56b7e3d1af24", "ja": "侵入者を威嚇してみるのはどうだ？　大声で叫んだり、\n睨んでみたり。相手もビックリして諦めると思うんだ。", "zh": "试着威吓一下闯入者怎么样？比如大声喊叫，\n或者瞪着对方。我想对方也会吓一跳然后放弃的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7501_036kan", "source_sha256": "428717e888067173cf629582fb359bf54758d763b43d63d43cdb3fdfd4f6a01f", "ja": "確かにそうですね！　それに大声なら自信があります！\n「ガオ～ッ！　こっちに来たら食べちゃうぞー！」", "zh": "确实有道理！而且大声喊叫我最拿手了！\n\"嗷——！敢过来就把你吃掉——！\"", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7502_036kan", "source_sha256": "e18c0232cadf760c6a6322119ad24221ef35e1ea6ae8afeacbb56e9f331b2bb8", "ja": "「お宝は諦めろ～！　ガオガオ～ン！」\nいっぱい叫んで侵入者を撃退しますね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "“休想打宝物的主意～！嗷呜嗷呜～！”\n我要大声叫喊击退入侵者哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7600_p", "source_sha256": "f43b2b6ac45c9a99d6e7202b69cfee1871bea77f4353c1791bbd56b7e3d1af24", "ja": "侵入者を威嚇してみるのはどうだ？　大声で叫んだり、\n睨んでみたり。相手もビックリして諦めると思うんだ。", "zh": "试着威吓一下闯入者怎么样？比如大声喊叫，\n或者瞪着对方。我想对方也会吓一跳然后放弃的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7601_036kan", "source_sha256": "2e6401d9489fcc2866e621b7481053a59402c5f5b5eafd1e286a53cbd9226f80", "ja": "なるほど……。動物に睨まれたりすると、怖くて\n近づけないですもんね。私、ちょっと試してみますね！", "zh": "原来如此……被动物瞪着的话，会因为害怕而不敢靠近呢。我这就试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_7602_036kan", "source_sha256": "af4c5ee45069194a400d4b7b703b379f357e317240d28761373fefd59d0aca0e", "ja": "むむむっ！　どうですか、「あっち行け～！」っていう\n視線を送っているんですけど……伝わりましたか？", "zh": "唔唔唔！感觉怎么样？我正用“走开啦～！”的\n眼神看着您呢……传达到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
